\(\[CapitalOmega]\), \(0\)]\)t + \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(t\), \(1\)]\)]\\n\>\"", 
       ",", "\"\<\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(A\), \(0\)]\) = \
\!\(\*FractionBox[\(a\), \(8\)]\)\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(\[Theta]\), \
\(3\)]\)(1 + \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(b\), \(1\)]\) \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(\
