\), \(4\)]\) \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(\[Theta]\), \(5\)]\) + \
\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(b\), \(5\)]\) \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(\[Theta]\), \
\(6\)]\)\\n\>\"", 
